#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every OpenMV IDE v1.x.x release brought new features and improvements. "
"Here's what changed in each one — new editor, camera, and tooling features, "
"bug fixes, and platform support. Releases are listed newest first; click a "
"version to open its changelog."
msgstr ""
"Elke OpenMV IDE v1.x.x-release bracht nieuwe functies en verbeteringen. Hier"
" is wat er in elke release veranderde — nieuwe editor-, camera- en "
"toolfuncties, bugfixes en platformondersteuning. Releases staan nieuwste "
"eerst; klik op een versie om de changelog ervan te openen."

